:name: STM32F4DISCOVERY - GUI (Renode)
:description: Memuat firmware dan menjalankan emulasi tanpa quit, untuk diamati di GUI Renode.
:description: Jalankan dari root project: renode -e "i @renode/blinky_gui.resc"

using sysbus
mach create "stm32f4discovery"

machine LoadPlatformDescription @renode/stm32f4discovery_blinky.repl

sysbus LoadELF @.pio/build/disco_f407vg/firmware.elf

# Jalankan emulasi dan biarkan Renode tetap terbuka.
start

# Tips: pantau state LED di Monitor, contoh:
#   sysbus.gpioPortD.LED4_Green State
#   sysbus.gpioPortD.LED3_Orange State
#   sysbus.gpioPortD.LED5_Red State
#   sysbus.gpioPortD.LED6_Blue State
#
# Tombol B1:   sysbus.gpioPortA.UserButton Press   /  Release
# Pantau berkala:  watch "sysbus.gpioPortD.LED4_Green State" 500
